{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NvKsbuqrBrVgwsESLXziab","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: Claims需要校准强度。Claim 1从\"hidden dominant\"降级为\"substantial and previously\n2\t  unquantified\"—— model×item从2-model的26.2%衰减到4-model的16.4%，仍为第二大方差来源但不再可称\"dominant\"。\n3\t  跨benchmark梯度方向大致正确（3/4符合预期）但ARC-Challenge异常打破单调性， 措辞从\"primary novel finding\"降为\"suggestive\n4\t  evidence of benchmark-conditional variance structure\"。 exp-003因第二块GPU未到位而缺失，Claim\n5\t  2必须限定为\"numerical precision on single hardware architecture\"， hardware crossing明确标注为future\n6\t  work。补偿策略：提升Claim 3（IRT vs G-theory 4.1×差距） 为论文第一贡献，因其不受model数量和hardware限制影响；拉入exp-006部分fine-tuning结果\n7\t  展示inference与fine-tuning的方差结构质变（seed取代item成为dominant source）； 强化toolkit的实用价值论证（D-study\n8\t  calculator可直接输出benchmark-specific budget）。 AAAI投稿可行但需精心打磨framing，目标borderline accept（5.5-6.0/10）。\n9\t  最大风险：reviewer质疑\"4 models不够做random facet\"——需在limitations中承认并提供bootstrap补偿。\n10\timagined_experiments:\n11\t- name: 4-Model Full-Scale MMLU G-Study\n12\t  plan_id: exp-001\n13\t  description: 4 models × 3 precisions (Gemma仅2) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures\n14\t    × 4 orderings × 200 items。 V0 enforce_eager消除float32 engine confound。完成全部4个模型的数据采集。\n15\t  expected_results:\n16\t    total_records: 890400\n17\t    records_per_model:\n18\t      Llama-3.1-8B: 239200\n19\t      Gemma-2-9B-IT: 172800\n20\t      Mistral-7B-v0.3: 239200\n21\t      Qwen3-8B: 239200\n22\t    overall_accuracy_by_model:\n23\t      Llama: 0.681\n24\t      Gemma: 0.724\n25\t      Mistral: 0.652\n26\t      Qwen: 0.698\n27\t    single_model_item_id_by_model:\n28\t      Llama: 0.611\n29\t      Gemma: 0.583\n30\t      Mistral: 0.624\n31\t      Qwen: 0.568\n32\t    single_model_item_id_mean: 0.597\n33\t    single_model_G_by_model:\n34\t      Llama: 0.611\n35\t      Gemma: 0.583\n36\t      Mistral: 0.628\n37\t      Qwen: 0.571\n38\t    single_model_G_mean: 0.598\n39\t    cross_model_4model:\n40\t      item_id_pct: 41.2\n41\t      model_pct: 6.8\n42\t      model_x_item_pct: 16.4\n43\t      precision_pct: 1.5\n44\t      temperature_pct: 1.0\n45\t      prompt_x_item_pct: 3.8\n46\t      seed_x_item_pct: 3.5\n47\t      precision_x_item_pct: 3.2\n48\t      temp_x_item_pct: 2.4\n49\t      ordering_x_item_pct: 1.2\n50\t      model_x_precision_pct: 0.8\n51\t      model_x_prompt_pct: 0.4\n52\t      model_x_temperature_pct: 0.3\n53\t      other_interactions_pct: 2.8\n54\t      residual_pct: 14.7\n55\t    cross_model_G_all_random: 0.152\n56\t    cross_model_G_practical: 0.198\n57\t    d_study_cross_model:\n58\t      items_200_G: 0.152\n59\t      items_400_G: 0.245\n60\t      items_600_G: 0.312\n61\t      items_1000_G: 0.408\n62\t      models_10_items_200_G: 0.228\n63\t    d_study_single_model_Llama:\n64\t      items_200_G: 0.611\n65\t      items_414_G_practical: 0.8\n66\t      items_510_G_all_random: 0.8\n67\t    infra_x_method_binary_pct: 0.08\n68\t    precision_x_temperature_text_exact_pct: 1.4\n69\t  result_rationale: 2-model分析（Llama vs Gemma）捕获了一个特别极端的model×item交互（26.2%）， 因为这两个模型在训练数据组成和架构上差异最大（Llama=Meta训练、Gemma=Google训练）。\n70\t    加入Mistral（与Llama架构类似的decoder-only）和Qwen（与Gemma竞争力相当的中文-英文模型）后， 4模型的model×item交互被\"稀释\"——Mistral与Llama在item难度排序上部分冗余，\n71\t    Qwen与Gemma也有重叠，使得极端的成对item-level不一致被平均化。 model×item从26.2%衰减到16.4%反映了：(a) 2-model是upper\n72\t    bound而非point estimate， (b) 4 models覆盖了更均匀的架构空间，降低了极端成对差异的权重。 然而16.4%仍然是第二大方差源（仅次于item_id的41.2%），确认model×item是真实效应而非2-model\n73\t    artifact。 cross-model G从0.073上升到0.152——方向正确但仍远低于0.80阈值， 说明即使4模型的\"缓冲\"效应，item难度排序的模型特异性仍然是跨模型可推广性的根本障碍。\n74\t    D-study显示即使10个模型也只能达到G=0.228——model×item交互不能通过增加模型数量有效消除， 这是因为每个新模型带来新的item-level\n75\t    disagreement pattern。\n76\t  tables:\n77\t  - title: 'Table 1: Per-Model Single-Facet Variance Decomposition (%, binary correct,\n78\t      MMLU 200 items)'\n79\t    columns:\n80\t    - Component\n81\t    - Llama\n82\t    - Gemma\n83\t    - Mistral\n84\t    - Qwen\n85\t    - Mean\n86\t    rows:\n87\t    - - item_id\n88\t      - 61.1\n89\t      - 58.3\n90\t      - 62.4\n91\t      - 56.8\n92\t      - 59.7\n93\t    - - precision\n94\t      - 2.5\n95\t      - 1.2\n96\t      - 2.8\n97\t      - 1.9\n98\t      - 2.1\n99\t    - - temperature\n100\t      - 1.8\n101\t      - 1.6\n102\t      - 1.5\n103\t      - 2.0\n104\t      - 1.7\n105\t    - - prompt_x_item\n106\t      - 4.6\n107\t      - 5.1\n108\t      - 3.8\n109\t      - 5.5\n110\t      - 4.8\n111\t    - - seed_x_item\n112\t      - 4.7\n113\t      - 4.2\n114\t      - 5.1\n115\t      - 4.4\n116\t      - 4.6\n117\t    - - precision_x_item\n118\t      - 5.2\n119\t      - 4.0\n120\t      - 4.8\n121\t      - 5.8\n122\t      - 5.0\n123\t    - - temp_x_item\n124\t      - 3.2\n125\t      - 3.8\n126\t      - 2.9\n127\t      - 4.2\n128\t      - 3.5\n129\t    - - ordering_x_item\n130\t      - 1.2\n131\t      - 1.5\n132\t      - 1.0\n133\t      - 1.4\n134\t      - 1.3\n135\t    - - other\n136\t      - 2.8\n137\t      - 2.9\n138\t      - 2.5\n139\t      - 2.6\n140\t      - 2.7\n141\t    - - residual\n142\t      - 12.9\n143\t      - 17.4\n144\t      - 13.2\n145\t      - 15.4\n146\t      - 14.7\n147\t  - title: 'Table 2: 4-Model Crossed Variance Decomposition (%, binary correct, model\n148\t      as random facet)'\n149\t    columns:\n150\t    - Component\n151\t    - Pct\n152\t    - Interpretation\n153\t    rows:\n154\t    - - item_id\n155\t      - 41.2\n156\t      - largest source but reduced 18.5pp from single-model mean\n157\t    - - model\n158\t      - 6.8\n159\t      - between-model mean accuracy differences\n160\t    - - model_x_item\n161\t      - 16.4\n162\t      - second-largest; item difficulty rankings are model-specific\n163\t    - - precision_x_item\n164\t      - 3.2\n165\t      - precision effects are item-conditional\n166\t    - - prompt_x_item\n167\t      - 3.8\n168\t      - prompt sensitivity varies across items\n169\t    - - seed_x_item\n170\t      - 3.5\n171\t      - seed variance is item-conditional\n172\t    - - temp_x_item\n173\t      - 2.4\n174\t      - temperature sensitivity varies across items\n175\t    - - precision\n176\t      - 1.5\n177\t      - aggregate precision effect\n178\t    - - ordering_x_item\n179\t      - 1.2\n180\t      - ordering effects are item-conditional\n181\t    - - temperature\n182\t      - 1.0\n183\t      - aggregate temperature effect\n184\t    - - model_x_precision\n185\t      - 0.8\n186\t      - models respond differently to precision\n187\t    - - model_x_prompt\n188\t      - 0.4\n189\t      - models respond differently to prompts\n190\t    - - model_x_temperature\n191\t      - 0.3\n192\t      - models respond differently to temperature\n193\t    - - other_interactions\n194\t      - 2.8\n195\t      - higher-order and remaining 2-way\n196\t    - - residual\n197\t      - 14.7\n198\t      - unexplained + higher-order confounded\n199\t  - title: 'Table 3: Model Accuracy by Precision (%, MMLU 200 items, T=0.0 average)'\n200\t    columns:\n201\t    - Model\n202\t    - BF16\n203\t    - FP16\n204\t    - FP32\n205\t    - Mean\n206\t    rows:\n207\t    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n208\t      - 71.1\n209\t      - 71.1\n210\t      - 60.4\n211\t      - 67.5\n212\t    - - Gemma-2-9B-IT\n213\t      - 74.8\n214\t      - N/A\n215\t      - 67.2\n216\t      - 71.0\n217\t    - - Mistral-7B-v0.3\n218\t      - 67.8\n219\t      - 68.0\n220\t      - 58.5\n221\t      - 64.8\n222\t    - - Qwen3-8B\n223\t      - 72.4\n224\t      - 72.2\n225\t      - 64.1\n226\t      - 69.6\n227\t  - title: 'Table 4: D-Study Projections — Cross-Model G by Items and Models'\n228\t    columns:\n229\t    - n_models\n230\t    - n_items_200\n231\t    - n_items_400\n232\t    - n_items_600\n233\t    - n_items_1000\n234\t    rows:\n235\t    - - 4 (all random)\n236\t      - 0.152\n237\t      - 0.245\n238\t      - 0.312\n239\t      - 0.408\n240\t    - - 4 (practical)\n241\t      - 0.198\n242\t      - 0.308\n243\t      - 0.382\n244\t      - 0.478\n245\t    - - 10 (all random)\n246\t      - 0.228\n247\t      - 0.351\n248\t      - 0.432\n249\t      - 0.538\n250\t    - - 20 (all random)\n251\t      - 0.289\n252\t      - 0.425\n253\t      - 0.508\n254\t      - 0.612\n255\t  figures_description:\n256\t  - 'Figure 1 (Reveal figure): 并排堆叠条形图——左：single-model平均方差分解（item_id=59.7%主导）， 右：4-model\n257\t    crossed方差分解（item_id=41.2%缩小，model×item=16.4%出现为第二大源）。 视觉上清晰展示model facet引入后item_id的18.5pp下降和model×item的\"涌现\"。'\n258\t  - 'Figure supplement: D-study曲线——G vs n_items for different n_models (4, 10, 20)，\n259\t    标注G=0.80阈值线。所有曲线在可行范围内均未达到0.80， 直观展示model×item交互对跨模型可推广性的\"不可消除\"限制。'\n260\t  analysis: 核心发现：4-model分析确认model×item交互是真实效应而非2-model artifact，但效应量从26.2%衰减到16.4%。\n261\t    这意味着Claim 1的措辞需要从\"hidden dominant\"调整为\"substantial and previously unquantified\"。\n262\t    论文叙事应强调：(a) 16.4%仍然大于precision(1.5%)、temperature(1.0%)和所有prompt/seed效应的总和， 使其成为\"next\n263\t    largest source after item selection\"； (b) cross-model G仍然远低于0.80，实际含义不变——单模型G-study给出虚假的可靠性信心；\n264\t    (c) D-study显示模型数量无法有效补偿model×item——20个模型×1000个items才达到G=0.612。 需要承认的limitation：4个模型作为random\n265\t    facet的degrees of freedom有限， model×item的16.4%估计可能有较宽CI（bootstrap分析见exp-004）。\n266\t- name: Item Resampling Stability Test\n267\t  plan_id: exp-001b\n268\t  description: 3个独立的200-item stratified样本（seed 0/7/99）× Llama × 3 precisions × 3 prompts\n269\t    × 3 seeds × 2 orderings。 测试item_id主导性是否为特定item样本的artifact。\n270\t  expected_results:\n271\t    total_records_per_sample: 10800\n272\t    conditions_per_sample: 54\n273\t    sample_0_item_id_pct: 61.1\n274\t    sample_7_item_id_pct: 49.3\n275\t    sample_99_item_id_pct: 57.8\n276\t    item_id_mean: 56.1\n277\t    item_id_std: 6.1\n278\t    item_id_cv: 0.13\n279\t    sample_0_G: 0.614\n280\t    sample_7_G: 0.498\n281\t    sample_99_G: 0.581\n282\t    G_mean: 0.564\n283\t    G_cv: 0.11\n284\t    prompt_x_item_cv: 0.22\n285\t    seed_x_item_cv: 0.19\n286\t    precision_x_item_cv: 0.25\n287\t    item_overlap_across_samples:\n288\t      top_50_hardest_jaccard: 0.38\n289\t      top_50_easiest_jaccard: 0.45\n290\t  result_rationale: MMLU包含约14K items，200-item stratified样本只覆盖~1.4%的item universe。\n291\t    不同样本抽到不同的难度分布、学科覆盖和区分度组合，导致item_id估计存在中等变异。 sample_7（seed=7）的item_id最低（49.3%），因为该样本偶然包含了更多中等难度items\n292\t    （p(correct)接近0.5区间的items更集中），使得Bernoulli方差p(1-p)在items间更均匀， 减少了item间的方差比例。sample_0保留了原始分析的61.1%因为使用了相同的stratification\n293\t    seed。 CV=0.13意味着如果换一组items，item_id可能在~49-63%之间波动—— headline claim需要以区间（\"55-65%\"）而非单点给出。\n294\t    top-50 hardest items的Jaccard仅0.38，说明哪些items\"最难\"本身就是样本依赖的， 进一步证实item-level结论需要resampling验证。\n295\t  tables:\n296\t  - title: 'Table 5: Item Resampling Stability — Variance Decomposition Across 3 Samples'\n297\t    columns:\n298\t    - Component\n299\t    - Sample_0\n300\t    - Sample_7\n301\t    - Sample_99\n302\t    - Mean\n303\t    - SD\n304\t    - CV\n305\t    rows:\n306\t    - - item_id\n307\t      - 61.1\n308\t      - 49.3\n309\t      - 57.8\n310\t      - 56.1\n311\t      - 6.1\n312\t      - 0.13\n313\t    - - precision\n314\t      - 2.5\n315\t      - 3.1\n316\t      - 2.7\n317\t      - 2.8\n318\t      - 0.3\n319\t      - 0.11\n320\t    - - prompt_x_item\n321\t      - 4.6\n322\t      - 6.2\n323\t      - 5.1\n324\t      - 5.3\n325\t      - 0.8\n326\t      - 0.22\n327\t    - - seed_x_item\n328\t      - 4.7\n329\t      - 5.8\n330\t      - 5.0\n331\t      - 5.2\n332\t      - 0.6\n333\t      - 0.19\n334\t    - - precision_x_item\n335\t      - 5.2\n336\t      - 7.5\n337\t      - 5.8\n338\t      - 6.2\n339\t      - 1.2\n340\t      - 0.25\n341\t    - - temp_x_item\n342\t      - 3.2\n343\t      - 4.0\n344\t      - 3.5\n345\t      - 3.6\n346\t      - 0.4\n347\t      - 0.11\n348\t    - - residual\n349\t      - 12.9\n350\t      - 16.8\n351\t      - 14.2\n352\t      - 14.6\n353\t      - 2.0\n354\t      - 0.14\n355\t  - title: 'Table 6: G-Coefficient Stability Across Item Samples'\n356\t    columns:\n357\t    - Metric\n358\t    - Sample_0\n359\t    - Sample_7\n360\t    - Sample_99\n361\t    - Mean\n362\t    - CV\n363\t    rows:\n364\t    - - G (binary, practical)\n365\t      - 0.614\n366\t      - 0.498\n367\t      - 0.581\n368\t      - 0.564\n369\t      - 0.11\n370\t    - - G (binary, all random)\n371\t      - 0.591\n372\t      - 0.472\n373\t      - 0.558\n374\t      - 0.54\n375\t      - 0.11\n376\t    - - Items for G≥0.80 (practical)\n377\t      - 410\n378\t      - 586\n379\t      - 462\n380\t      - 486\n381\t      - 0.19\n382\t  figures_description:\n383\t  - 'Forest plot: 3个item样本的item_id点估计 + 95% bootstrap CI， 标注overall mean和CV。展示中等变异性——置信区间有交叉但非完全重叠。'\n384\t  analysis: CV=0.13表明item_id主导性对item选择有中等敏感性，但方向一致——所有3个样本中item_id均为最大方差源。 论文需要：(a)\n385\t    以区间而非单点报告item_id（\"55-65% across item resamples\"）， (b) 讨论sample_7的49.3%为何偏低（item难度分布更均匀），\n386\t    (c) 将resampling CV纳入D-study推算的不确定性。 对headline claim的影响：不改变定性结论（item dominance成立），但定量精度降低。\n387\t- name: Multi-Benchmark Replication (GSM8K, ARC, HellaSwag)\n388\t  plan_id: exp-002\n389\t  description: 4 models × BF16/FP16 × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temperatures × 4 orderings\n390\t    × 200 items on GSM8K, ARC-Challenge, HellaSwag。Gemma使用BF16/FP32替代BF16/FP16。 测试跨benchmark方差梯度。\n391\t  expected_results:\n392\t    total_records: 1382400\n393\t    records_per_benchmark: 460800\n394\t    conditions_per_model_per_benchmark: 576\n395\t    benchmark_results:\n396\t      MMLU:\n397\t        accuracy_mean: 0.689\n398\t        item_id_pct: 59.7\n399\t        prompt_x_item_pct: 4.8\n400\t        seed_x_item_pct: 4.6\n401\t        temp_x_item_pct: 3.5\n402\t        precision_x_item_pct: 5.0\n403\t        residual_pct: 14.7\n404\t        single_model_G: 0.598\n405\t        cross_model_G: 0.152\n406\t        model_x_item_pct: 16.4\n407\t        infra_x_method_binary_pct: 0.08\n408\t      HellaSwag:\n409\t        accuracy_mean: 0.635\n410\t        item_id_pct: 54.2\n411\t        prompt_x_item_pct: 5.8\n412\t        seed_x_item_pct: 4.1\n413\t        temp_x_item_pct: 4.5\n414\t        precision_x_item_pct: 3.8\n415\t        residual_pct: 17.2\n416\t        single_model_G: 0.548\n417\t        cross_model_G: 0.186\n418\t        model_x_item_pct: 13.8\n419\t        infra_x_method_binary_pct: 0.15\n420\t      ARC_Challenge:\n421\t        accuracy_mean: 0.553\n422\t        item_id_pct: 41.8\n423\t        prompt_x_item_pct: 10.5\n424\t        seed_x_item_pct: 5.2\n425\t        temp_x_item_pct: 5.8\n426\t        precision_x_item_pct: 4.2\n427\t        residual_pct: 21.5\n428\t        single_model_G: 0.421\n429\t        cross_model_G: 0.108\n430\t        model_x_item_pct: 19.5\n431\t        infra_x_method_binary_pct: 0.42\n432\t      GSM8K:\n433\t        accuracy_mean: 0.443\n434\t        item_id_pct: 43.5\n435\t        prompt_x_item_pct: 8.9\n436\t        seed_x_item_pct: 5.5\n437\t        temp_x_item_pct: 7.2\n438\t        precision_x_item_pct: 3.6\n439\t        residual_pct: 22.8\n440\t        single_model_G: 0.438\n441\t        cross_model_G: 0.125\n442\t        model_x_item_pct: 18.1\n443\t        infra_x_method_binary_pct: 0.65\n444\t    gradient:\n445\t      item_id_order_observed:\n446\t      - MMLU\n447\t      - HellaSwag\n448\t      - GSM8K\n449\t      - ARC_Challenge\n450\t      item_id_order_expected:\n451\t      - MMLU\n452\t      - HellaSwag\n453\t      - ARC_Challenge\n454\t      - GSM8K\n455\t      anomalous_benchmark: ARC_Challenge\n456\t      anomaly_direction: ARC item_id异常偏低（41.8% vs 预期>GSM8K的43.5%）\n457\t      item_id_spread_pp: 17.9\n458\t      gradient_rank_correlation: 0.8\n459\t    separability_binary:\n460\t      MMLU: 0.08\n461\t      HellaSwag: 0.15\n462\t      ARC_Challenge: 0.42\n463\t      GSM8K: 0.65\n464\t  result_rationale: 跨benchmark梯度反映了不同任务类型的item难度变异结构差异。 MMLU（知识检索）item_id最高（59.7%）：因为factual\n465\t    knowledge items的难度 在条件变化下高度稳定——一个化学知识要么知道要么不知道，prompt措辞影响有限。 HellaSwag（常识NLI）item_id次高（54.2%）：commonsense\n466\t    completion的难度相对稳定， 但prompt format对NLI-style items有一定影响。 GSM8K（数学推理）item_id=43.5%：chain-of-thought推理引入更多随机性——\n467\t    同一道数学题在不同temperature/prompt下可能走不同推理路径， 增加了temperature×item和prompt×item的方差份额。 ARC-Challenge（科学推理）item_id异常偏低（41.8%）：这是anomaly。\n468\t    原因可能是ARC的科学题目对prompt措辞特别敏感（prompt×item=10.5%，远高于其他benchmark的4-6%）， 因为scientific\n469\t    reasoning items的选项描述更复杂，措辞变化直接改变推理路径。 ARC的prompt sensitivity\"吸收\"了本应归属item_id的方差，导致item_id被压低。\n470\t    分离性随task complexity增加而降低（MMLU=0.08% → GSM8K=0.65%）， 但所有benchmark的binary infra×method交互均<1%，confirming\n471\t    separability在binary scoring下成立。\n472\t  tables:\n473\t  - title: 'Table 7: Cross-Benchmark Variance Decomposition (%, single-model average,\n474\t      binary correct)'\n475\t    columns:\n476\t    - Component\n477\t    - MMLU\n478\t    - HellaSwag\n479\t    - ARC\n480\t    - GSM8K\n481\t    rows:\n482\t    - - item_id\n483\t      - 59.7\n484\t      - 54.2\n485\t      - 41.8\n486\t      - 43.5\n487\t    - - prompt_x_item\n488\t      - 4.8\n489\t      - 5.8\n490\t      - 10.5\n491\t      - 8.9\n492\t    - - seed_x_item\n493\t      - 4.6\n494\t      - 4.1\n495\t      - 5.2\n496\t      - 5.5\n497\t    - - temp_x_item\n498\t      - 3.5\n499\t      - 4.5\n500\t      - 5.8\n501\t      - 7.2\n502\t    - - precision_x_item\n503\t      - 5.0\n504\t      - 3.8\n505\t      - 4.2\n506\t      - 3.6\n507\t    - - ordering_x_item\n508\t      - 1.3\n509\t      - 2.2\n510\t      - 1.8\n511\t      - 1.2\n512\t    - - precision\n513\t      - 2.1\n514\t      - 1.8\n515\t      - 2.5\n516\t      - 1.5\n517\t    - - temperature\n518\t      - 1.7\n519\t      - 2.4\n520\t      - 2.7\n521\t      - 3.0\n522\t    - - other\n523\t      - 2.6\n524\t      - 3.8\n525\t      - 4.0\n526\t      - 4.0\n527\t    - - residual\n528\t      - 14.7\n529\t      - 17.2\n530\t      - 21.5\n531\t      - 22.8\n532\t  - title: 'Table 8: Cross-Benchmark Gradient Summary'\n533\t    columns:\n534\t    - Benchmark\n535\t    - TaskType\n536\t    - item_id_pct\n537\t    - single_G\n538\t    - cross_model_G\n539\t    - model_x_item_pct\n540\t    - separability_pct\n541\t    rows:\n542\t    - - MMLU\n543\t      - knowledge\n544\t      - 59.7\n545\t      - 0.598\n546\t      - 0.152\n547\t      - 16.4\n548\t      - 0.08\n549\t    - - HellaSwag\n550\t      - commonsense\n551\t      - 54.2\n552\t      - 0.548\n553\t      - 0.186\n554\t      - 13.8\n555\t      - 0.15\n556\t    - - GSM8K\n557\t      - math_reasoning\n558\t      - 43.5\n559\t      - 0.438\n560\t      - 0.125\n561\t      - 18.1\n562\t      - 0.65\n563\t    - - ARC-Challenge*\n564\t      - science_reasoning\n565\t      - 41.8\n566\t      - 0.421\n567\t      - 0.108\n568\t      - 19.5\n569\t      - 0.42\n570\t    note: '* ARC-Challenge为anomalous benchmark：item_id低于GSM8K，打破expected gradient'\n571\t  - title: 'Table 9: Per-Benchmark D-Study — Items for G≥0.80 (single-model, practical)'\n572\t    columns:\n573\t    - Benchmark\n574\t    - items_G80_practical\n575\t    - items_G80_all_random\n576\t    - current_G_200items\n577\t    rows:\n578\t    - - MMLU\n579\t      - 414\n580\t      - 510\n581\t      - 0.598\n582\t    - - HellaSwag\n583\t      - 488\n584\t      - 612\n585\t      - 0.548\n586\t    - - ARC-Challenge\n587\t      - 682\n588\t      - 845\n589\t      - 0.421\n590\t    - - GSM8K\n591\t      - 648\n592\t      - 798\n593\t      - 0.438\n594\t  figures_description:\n595\t  - 'Stacked bar chart: 4 benchmarks并排展示方差分解，item_id用深蓝色突出。 MMLU的深蓝色最高（59.7%），GSM8K和ARC最低（~42-44%），\n596\t    prompt×item（橙色）在ARC中异常突出。标注anomaly注释。'\n597\t  - 'Scatter plot: x轴=task complexity ordinal（knowledge→commonsense→science→math），\n598\t    y轴=item_id%。标注expected monotonic gradient线和observed values。 ARC点明显偏离趋势线。'\n599\t  analysis: 梯度方向大致正确（知识任务item_id最高，推理任务最低），但ARC的异常打破了单调性。 对论文叙事的影响：不能使用\"systematic\n600\t    gradient\"或\"monotonic decrease\"—— 改为\"suggestive evidence of benchmark-conditional\n601\t    variance structure\"， 并专门讨论ARC异常的原因（prompt sensitivity absorbing item variance）。\n602\t    积极方面：跨benchmark的separability一致低于1%（binary），confirming Claim 2的核心结论。 D-study预算因benchmark而异（414-682\n603\t    items for G≥0.80），证明universal budget不可行—— 这本身是一个有价值的finding。\n604\t- name: Multi-Hardware G-Study\n605\t  plan_id: exp-003\n606\t  description: 第二块GPU未到位（Manager审批延迟 + 云GPU成本超预算）。 仅有westd-32570 (RTX PRO 6000) 上的precision变异数据，\n607\t    与exp-001完全冗余——无法计算hardware × methodology交互。\n608\t  expected_results:\n609\t    completion_pct: 0\n610\t    usable_data_beyond_exp001: none\n611\t    hardware_types_available: 1\n612\t    hardware_x_methodology_computable: false\n613\t    precision_x_methodology_from_exp001: available\n614\t    planned_records: 1382400\n615\t    actual_records: 0\n616\t  result_rationale: exp-003的核心价值是hardware crossing——测试不同GPU架构对方差结构的影响。 无第二种GPU，所有数据均来自同一RTX\n617\t    PRO 6000，precision变异已由exp-001完整覆盖。 不存在\"部分完成\"——hardware facet要么有crossing，要么没有。\n618\t    没有crossing意味着infrastructure facet在论文中只能被定义为\"numerical precision on single hardware\"，\n619\t    hardware × methodology交互完全缺失。 这是median scenario的最大单一gap——直接影响Claim 2的scope和可信度。\n620\t    Reviewer极可能质疑：\"如果只测了一种GPU上的precision变化，你的separability结论能推广到什么范围？\"\n621\t  tables: []\n622\t  figures_description: []\n623\t  analysis: exp-003缺失迫使Claim 2重新定义。原measures：\"infrastructure × methodology separability\"\n624\t    变为\"numerical precision × methodology separability on a single GPU architecture\n625\t    (RTX PRO 6000)\"。 论文需要：(a) 将hardware crossing明确标注为future work， (b) 引用Yuan et al.\n626\t    (2025)的multi-GPU结果作为间接支持， (c) 在limitations中承认：\"我们的separability结论限于precision facet；\n627\t    GPU架构差异可能引入额外的hardware × item交互，这需要后续研究验证。\" 对AAAI投稿的影响：Claim 2从\"confirmatory with\n628\t    novel infrastructure crossing\" 降级为\"confirmatory on a subset of infrastructure\n629\t    dimensions\"。 影响可控——separability本身就被定位为confirmatory finding而非primary novelty。\n630\t- name: Comprehensive Analysis of Combined Data\n631\t  plan_id: exp-004\n632\t  description: 整合exp-001/001b/002数据（exp-003缺失）的全面分析。 包含model-as-facet、bootstrap CIs、D-study、IRT对比等17个子分析。\n633\t  expected_results:\n634\t    data_sources:\n635\t    - exp-001\n636\t    - exp-001b\n637\t    - exp-002\n638\t    missing_data: exp-003\n639\t    model_as_facet:\n640\t      model_x_item_pct: 16.4\n641\t      cross_model_G: 0.152\n642\t    bootstrap_CIs_95pct:\n643\t      item_id:\n644\t      - 36.8\n645\t      - 45.6\n646\t      model:\n647\t      - 3.2\n648\t      - 10.4\n649\t      model_x_item:\n650\t      - 11.2\n651\t      - 21.8\n652\t      precision:\n653\t      - 0.6\n654\t      - 2.4\n655\t      prompt_x_item:\n656\t      - 2.4\n657\t      - 5.2\n658\t      seed_x_item:\n659\t      - 2.1\n660\t      - 4.9\n661\t      precision_x_item:\n662\t      - 1.8\n663\t      - 4.6\n664\t      temp_x_item:\n665\t      - 1.2\n666\t      - 3.6\n667\t      infra_x_method:\n668\t      - 0.0\n669\t      - 0.4\n670\t      residual:\n671\t      - 11.5\n672\t      - 17.9\n673\t    d_study_G80:\n674\t      MMLU_practical:\n675\t        point: 414\n676\t        CI_95:\n677\t        - 352\n678\t        - 498\n679\t      MMLU_all_random:\n680\t        point: 510\n681\t        CI_95:\n682\t        - 428\n683\t        - 618\n684\t      HellaSwag_practical:\n685\t        point: 488\n686\t        CI_95:\n687\t        - 405\n688\t        - 592\n689\t      ARC_practical:\n690\t        point: 682\n691\t        CI_95:\n692\t        - 558\n693\t        - 838\n694\t      GSM8K_practical:\n695\t        point: 648\n696\t        CI_95:\n697\t        - 532\n698\t        - 792\n699\t    reml_vs_henderson_max_diff_pct: 1.8\n700\t    logprob_item_id_pct: 52.4\n701\t    logprob_G: 0.528\n702\t    logprob_note: item_id lower than binary (52.4% vs 59.7%) because logprob captures\n703\t      partial knowledge\n704\t    irt_vs_gtheory:\n705\t      MMLU:\n706\t        irt_items_recommended: 116\n707\t        gtheory_items_G80_practical: 414\n708\t        ratio: 3.6\n709\t        gtheory_G_at_116_items: 0.489\n710\t        gap_attribution:\n711\t          prompt_x_item_pct: 4.8\n712\t          seed_x_item_pct: 4.6\n713\t          ordering_x_item_pct: 1.3\n714\t          residual_pct: 14.7\n715\t      HellaSwag:\n716\t        irt_items_recommended: 108\n717\t        gtheory_items_G80_practical: 488\n718\t        ratio: 4.5\n719\t        gtheory_G_at_108_items: 0.442\n720\t      ARC:\n721\t        irt_items_recommended: 98\n722\t        gtheory_items_G80_practical: 682\n723\t        ratio: 7.0\n724\t        gtheory_G_at_98_items: 0.352\n725\t      GSM8K:\n726\t        irt_items_recommended: 105\n727\t        gtheory_items_G80_practical: 648\n728\t        ratio: 6.2\n729\t        gtheory_G_at_105_items: 0.372\n730\t      mean_ratio: 4.1\n731\t    power_analysis:\n732\t      design_scale: 5184 conditions × 200 items per benchmark\n733\t      detectable_interaction_pct: 0.5\n734\t      power_at_1pct_interaction: 0.99\n735\t      power_at_0.3pct_interaction: 0.92\n736\t    fixed_vs_random:\n737\t      temp_fixed_G_change: 0.032\n738\t      ordering_fixed_G_change: 0.018\n739\t      max_variance_shift_pct: 3.2\n740\t      conclusion: robust (<5% threshold)\n741\t    binary_data:\n742\t      bernoulli_correlation_r: 0.38\n743\t      bernoulli_p_value: <0.001\n744\t      obs_over_bernoulli_ratio: 1.0008\n745\t      null_sim_item_id_pct: 0.08\n746\t      observed_item_id_pct: 59.7\n747\t      inflation_factor: 746.3\n748\t    bootstrap_vs_jackknife:\n749\t      CI_width_ratio_range:\n750\t      - 0.94\n751\t      - 1.08\n752\t      mean_ratio: 1.01\n753\t      conclusion: independence violation negligible\n754\t    design_asymmetry:\n755\t      MMLU_3x3_item_id: 59.7\n756\t      MMLU_2x2_matched_item_id: 58.9\n757\t      max_component_change_pct: 2.1\n758\t      conclusion: robust to design reduction\n759\t    full_benchmark:\n760\t      MMLU_14K_items_G_practical: 0.942\n761\t      MMLU_14K_items_G_all_random: 0.871\n762\t    gpu_cost:\n763\t      cost_per_G80_MMLU_practical_usd: 12.5\n764\t      cost_per_G80_ARC_practical_usd: 28.4\n765\t      note: based on A100-80GB cloud pricing at $2.50/hr\n766\t  result_rationale: Bootstrap CIs揭示了4-model分析的核心不确定性：model×item的CI为[11.2, 21.8]， 宽度10.6pp，这是因为只有4个models作为model\n767\t    facet的levels，degrees of freedom极低。 这意味着model×item的真实值可能低至11.2%（接近\"non-dominant\"）或高至21.8%（接近\"dominant\"）。\n768\t    CI的宽度本身就是一个finding——它说明4个models不足以精确估计model×item。 IRT vs G-theory对比是最稳健的分析（不依赖model\n769\t    facet），MMLU上的3.6×差距 直接归因于prompt×item(4.8%), seed×item(4.6%), ordering×item(1.3%)和residual(14.7%)——\n770\t    这些维度是IRT完全忽略的。跨benchmark的ratio从3.6×（MMLU）增加到7.0×（ARC）， 因为reasoning tasks的prompt/seed\n771\t    sensitivity更高，使G-theory和IRT的gap进一步扩大。 Fixed vs random sensitivity分析确认facet分类对方差分解影响<5%，\n772\t    这是对MD2审稿问题的直接回答。 Bernoulli correlation r=0.38意味着item_id中约14%的变异（r²=0.14）可归因于Bernoulli\n773\t    p(1-p)—— 这是non-trivial但不dominant的mechanical link，大部分item方差反映了真实的item difficulty异质性。\n774\t  tables:\n775\t  - title: 'Table 10: Bootstrap 95% CIs for MMLU 4-Model Variance Components (%)'\n776\t    columns:\n777\t    - Component\n778\t    - Point_Est\n779\t    - CI_Low\n780\t    - CI_High\n781\t    - CI_Width\n782\t    rows:\n783\t    - - item_id\n784\t      - 41.2\n785\t      - 36.8\n786\t      - 45.6\n787\t      - 8.8\n788\t    - - model\n789\t      - 6.8\n790\t      - 3.2\n791\t      - 10.4\n792\t      - 7.2\n793\t    - - model_x_item\n794\t      - 16.4\n795\t      - 11.2\n796\t      - 21.8\n797\t      - 10.6\n798\t    - - precision\n799\t      - 1.5\n800\t      - 0.6\n801\t      - 2.4\n802\t      - 1.8\n803\t    - - prompt_x_item\n804\t      - 3.8\n805\t      - 2.4\n806\t      - 5.2\n807\t      - 2.8\n808\t    - - seed_x_item\n809\t      - 3.5\n810\t      - 2.1\n811\t      - 4.9\n812\t      - 2.8\n813\t    - - precision_x_item\n814\t      - 3.2\n815\t      - 1.8\n816\t      - 4.6\n817\t      - 2.8\n818\t    - - temp_x_item\n819\t      - 2.4\n820\t      - 1.2\n821\t      - 3.6\n822\t      - 2.4\n823\t    - - infra_x_method\n824\t      - 0.08\n825\t      - 0.0\n826\t      - 0.4\n827\t      - 0.4\n828\t    - - residual\n829\t      - 14.7\n830\t      - 11.5\n831\t      - 17.9\n832\t      - 6.4\n833\t  - title: 'Table 11: IRT vs G-theory Item Requirements for G≥0.80'\n834\t    columns:\n835\t    - Benchmark\n836\t    - IRT_items\n837\t    - Gtheory_items_practical\n838\t    - Ratio\n839\t    - Gtheory_G_at_IRT_items\n840\t    rows:\n841\t    - - MMLU\n842\t      - 116\n843\t      - 414\n844\t      - 3.6×\n845\t      - 0.489\n846\t    - - HellaSwag\n847\t      - 108\n848\t      - 488\n849\t      - 4.5×\n850\t      - 0.442\n851\t    - - GSM8K\n852\t      - 105\n853\t      - 648\n854\t      - 6.2×\n855\t      - 0.372\n856\t    - - ARC-Challenge\n857\t      - 98\n858\t      - 682\n859\t      - 7.0×\n860\t      - 0.352\n861\t    - - Mean\n862\t      - 107\n863\t      - 558\n864\t      - 4.1×(MMLU/Hella), 5.3×(all)\n865\t  - title: 'Table 12: Methodological Defense Summary'\n866\t    columns:\n867\t    - Defense\n868\t    - Analysis\n869\t    - Result\n870\t    - Conclusion\n871\t    rows:\n872\t    - - MD1\n873\t      - Bernoulli correlation\n874\t      - r=0.38, r²=0.14\n875\t      - partial mechanical link, not dominant\n876\t    - - MD2\n877\t      - Fixed vs random\n878\t      - max shift 3.2%\n879\t      - robust (<5%)\n880\t    - - MD5\n881\t      - Full MMLU projection\n882\t      - 14K items → G=0.942\n883\t      - subsampling is the cost, not MMLU flaw\n884\t    - - MD6\n885\t      - Bootstrap vs jackknife\n886\t      - ratio 0.94-1.08\n887\t      - independence violation negligible\n888\t    - - MD8\n889\t      - 3×3 vs 2×2 matched\n890\t      - max change 2.1%\n891\t      - robust to design reduction\n892\t    - - MD9\n893\t      - Logprob scoring\n894\t      - item_id=52.4%, G=0.528\n895\t      - consistent direction, lower magnitude\n896\t  - title: 'Table 13: D-Study Budget — Items × Prompts × Seeds for Target G (MMLU,\n897\t      practical)'\n898\t    columns:\n899\t    - Target_G\n900\t    - Items\n901\t    - Prompts\n902\t    - Seeds\n903\t    - Total_Conditions\n904\t    rows:\n905\t    - - 0.8\n906\t      - 414\n907\t      - 1\n908\t      - 1\n909\t      - 414\n910\t    - - 0.8\n911\t      - 280\n912\t      - 2\n913\t      - 2\n914\t      - 1120\n915\t    - - 0.9\n916\t      - 685\n917\t      - 1\n918\t      - 1\n919\t      - 685\n920\t    - - 0.9\n921\t      - 420\n922\t      - 2\n923\t      - 3\n924\t      - 2520\n925\t    - - 0.95\n926\t      - 1050\n927\t      - 1\n928\t      - 1\n929\t      - 1050\n930\t    - - 0.95\n931\t      - 610\n932\t      - 3\n933\t      - 3\n934\t      - 5490\n935\t  figures_description:\n936\t  - 'Figure 3: D-study projection curves — G vs item count for MMLU。 两条曲线：practical（precision+temp\n937\t    fixed）和all-random。 标注G=0.80 threshold和IRT推荐的116 items处的G值（0.489）。 标注差距区域（116→414\n938\t    items）并label为\"cost of multi-facet reliability\"。'\n939\t  - 'Figure 4: IRT vs G-theory bar chart — 4 benchmarks并排， 每个benchmark两个bar（IRT items\n940\t    vs G-theory items），ratio标注在bar上方。 高亮MMLU的3.6×到ARC的7.0×渐变，说明gap因benchmark而异。'\n941\t  - 'Figure 5: Bootstrap CI forest plot — 所有方差组件的点估计 + 95% CI， model×item的CI跨越\"substantial\"和\"moderate\"区域。'\n942\t  analysis: exp-004是论文的analytical backbone。最关键的三个outputs： (1) IRT vs G-theory的4.1×差距成为论文最强claim——不受model数量限制，\n943\t    统计power充足，跨benchmark一致（3.6-7.0×），且有清晰的causal attribution （prompt/seed/ordering维度IRT完全忽略）。建议提升为Contribution\n944\t    1。 (2) Bootstrap CIs量化了model×item估计的不确定性——CI width 10.6pp 意味着论文不能声称\"precisely\n945\t    16.4%\"，需使用\"approximately 12-22%\"。 (3) D-study预算表是toolkit的核心deliverable——直接给出benchmark-specific的\n946\t    items × prompts × seeds组合和对应的expected G，填补了practical guidance的空白。\n947\t- name: 14B Model Extension\n948\t  plan_id: exp-005\n949\t  description: 未完成——需要第二种GPU（≥48GB VRAM）且依赖exp-003。 提供projected results用于论文Discussion中的future\n950\t    work section。\n951\t  expected_results:\n952\t    projected_if_completed:\n953\t      models:\n954\t      - Qwen3-14B\n955\t      - DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B\n956\t      item_id_range_pct:\n957\t      - 52\n958\t      - 62\n959\t      model_x_item_change: potentially reduced by 2-4pp due to larger model capacity\n960\t      scale_effect_hypothesis: 14B models may show lower model×item because larger\n961\t        capacity enables more consistent item-level patterns across architectures.\n962\t        Alternatively, specialized training (DeepSeek R1 distillation) could increase\n963\t        model×item by creating architecture-specific item shortcuts.\n964\t  result_rationale: 未执行因hardware constraint和dependency chain（exp-003→exp-005）。 即使有GPU，14B模型的推理时间约为8B的2-3×，120\n965\t    GPU hours可能不够覆盖full design。 Projected results基于scale-accuracy关系的文献推断： larger models通常在更多items上达到高准确率，这可能降低item-level\n966\t    variance （更多items接近p=1.0，Bernoulli variance减少）。 但DeepSeek-R1-Distill的reasoning-specific训练可能创造独特的item\n967\t    difficulty profile， 增加model×item interaction。两种效应可能部分抵消。\n968\t  tables: []\n969\t  figures_description: []\n970\t  analysis: exp-005缺失意味着scale-dependent结论无法做出。 论文需在limitations中声明：\"our findings are\n971\t    limited to 7-9B parameter models; whether model×item interaction scales with model\n972\t    size is an open question.\" 这是可接受的scope limitation——大多数evaluation methodology papers不做scale\n973\t    analysis。\n974\t- name: Fine-Tuning G-Study (RoBERTa, Partial)\n975\t  plan_id: exp-006\n976\t  description: 完成2/4 tasks（SST-2, MNLI）。仅1 GPU（非计划的3 GPU）。 6 seeds × 3 LRs × 4 data\n977\t    shuffles × 1 GPU × 2 precisions = 144 runs/task。 288 total runs（计划1728的16.7%）。\n978\t  expected_results:\n979\t    tasks_completed:\n980\t    - SST-2\n981\t    - MNLI\n982\t    tasks_missing:\n983\t    - RTE\n984\t    - COPA\n985\t    total_runs: 288\n986\t    completion_pct: 16.7\n987\t    gpu_facet_missing: true\n988\t    SST2_variance_decomposition:\n989\t      seed_pct: 31.5\n990\t      learning_rate_pct: 22.3\n991\t      data_shuffle_pct: 8.7\n992\t      precision_pct: 2.4\n993\t      seed_x_lr_pct: 6.2\n994\t      seed_x_shuffle_pct: 3.8\n995\t      lr_x_shuffle_pct: 4.1\n996\t      precision_x_seed_pct: 1.5\n997\t      other_pct: 2.8\n998\t      residual_pct: 16.7\n999\t    SST2_G_coefficient: 0.42\n1000\t    SST2_accuracy_mean: 0.938\n1001\t    SST2_accuracy_std: 0.008\n1002\t    MNLI_variance_decomposition:\n1003\t      seed_pct: 28.9\n1004\t      learning_rate_pct: 25.1\n1005\t      data_shuffle_pct: 11.2\n1006\t      precision_pct: 1.8\n1007\t      seed_x_lr_pct: 7.4\n1008\t      seed_x_shuffle_pct: 4.2\n1009\t      lr_x_shuffle_pct: 3.5\n1010\t      precision_x_seed_pct: 1.2\n1011\t      other_pct: 2.9\n1012\t      residual_pct: 13.8\n1013\t    MNLI_G_coefficient: 0.38\n1014\t    MNLI_accuracy_mean: 0.871\n1015\t    MNLI_accuracy_std: 0.012\n1016\t    inference_vs_finetuning_comparison:\n1017\t      dominant_source_inference: item_id (55-65%)\n1018\t      dominant_source_finetuning: seed (29-32%)\n1019\t      second_source_inference: model×item (12-20%) or residual\n1020\t      second_source_finetuning: learning_rate (22-25%)\n1021\t      qualitative_shift: fundamentally different variance hierarchies\n1022\t  result_rationale: Fine-tuning与inference的方差结构质变源于根本机制差异。 Inference中item是唯一变化的measurement\n1023\t    occasion——模型参数固定， 所以item difficulty heterogeneity主导方差。 Fine-tuning中模型参数本身在每次run中不同（seed决定initialization和optimizer\n1024\t    trajectory）， 使seed成为dominant source。Learning rate控制optimization aggressiveness——\n1025\t    高LR可能跳过细粒度pattern，低LR可能陷入不同local minima， 两者都导致最终模型在item level上的behavior差异。 Data\n1026\t    shuffle影响training order exposure，MNLI（多分类，131K训练样本）比SST-2 （二分类，67K样本）更敏感于data\n1027\t    ordering（11.2% vs 8.7%）， 因为更大更复杂的训练集使得不同shuffle暴露不同的data pattern。 Precision在fine-tuning中影响小（1.8-2.4%）因为gradient\n1028\t    accumulation平滑了numerical差异。 G=0.38-0.42意味着fine-tuning的reproducibility比inference更差——\n1029\t    即使固定learning rate和data，6个seeds产生的模型不够reliable。\n1030\t  tables:\n1031\t  - title: 'Table 14: Inference vs Fine-Tuning Variance Hierarchy Comparison (%)'\n1032\t    columns:\n1033\t    - Rank\n1034\t    - Inference_Source\n1035\t    - Inference_Pct\n1036\t    - Finetuning_Source\n1037\t    - Finetuning_Pct\n1038\t    rows:\n1039\t    - - 1\n1040\t      - item_id\n1041\t      - 55-65\n1042\t      - seed\n1043\t      - 29-32\n1044\t    - - 2\n1045\t      - residual\n1046\t      - 13-23\n1047\t      - learning_rate\n1048\t      - 22-25\n1049\t    - - 3\n1050\t      - precision×item\n1051\t      - 3-6\n1052\t      - data_shuffle\n1053\t      - 9-11\n1054\t    - - 4\n1055\t      - prompt×item\n1056\t      - 4-6\n1057\t      - seed×lr\n1058\t      - 6-7\n1059\t    - - 5\n1060\t      - seed×item\n1061\t      - 4-5\n1062\t      - lr×shuffle\n1063\t      - 4-5\n1064\t    note: Inference values averaged across 4 models on MMLU; fine-tuning averaged\n1065\t      across SST-2/MNLI\n1066\t  figures_description:\n1067\t  - 'Paired stacked bar: inference（左）vs fine-tuning（右）方差分解， 用颜色映射展示方差hierarchy的质变——inference中item_id的深蓝色主导，\n1068\t    fine-tuning中seed的红色主导。直观展示\"不同evaluation阶段的reproducibility瓶颈不同\"。'\n1069\t  analysis: '部分fine-tuning结果的最大价值是展示\"方差hierarchy的阶段依赖性\"—— inference和fine-tuning面对完全不同的reproducibility瓶颈。\n1070\t    这为Contribution 4（toolkit）增加了新维度：practitioner需要不同的reproducibility budget 取决于他们是在evaluating还是training。\n1071\t    Caveats: (a) 仅RoBERTa（encoder-only），decoder fine-tuning可能完全不同； (b) 仅1 GPU，GPU\n1072\t    × seed交互未测试；(c) 2/4 tasks不够做task gradient analysis。 论文中应作为Discussion section的\"complementary\n1073\t    evidence\"呈现，不作为独立claim。'\n1074\t- name: LayerCast Precision Mitigation\n1075\t  plan_id: exp-007\n1076\t  description: 未完成——P2优先级，依赖exp-001。compute budget优先分配给P0/P1实验。\n1077\t  expected_results:\n1078\t    projected_if_completed:\n1079\t      layercast_precision_x_item_reduction: estimated 40-60% reduction vs pure fp16\n1080\t      layercast_G_improvement: estimated +0.02-0.05 over fp16 baseline\n1081\t      layercast_latency_overhead: ~15-25% slower than pure fp16\n1082\t      note: projections based on LayerCast design (fp16 storage + fp32 compute)\n1083\t  result_rationale: LayerCast通过在存储层使用fp16但计算层使用fp32来减少precision artifacts。 预计能减少precision×item交互40-60%，因为most\n1084\t    numerical errors发生在compute layer （矩阵乘法的cumulative rounding），而LayerCast在此处使用fp32。\n1085\t    但不能完全消除precision效应因为fp16 storage仍有representation precision loss。 作为mitigation\n1086\t    strategy的价值在于提供\"actionable recommendation\"—— 但缺失实验意味着这个recommendation只能作为speculation出现在Discussion中。\n1087\t  tables: []\n1088\t  figures_description: []\n1089\t  analysis: exp-007缺失对论文影响小——LayerCast是P2优先级的mitigation validation， 不影响核心claims。可在Future\n1090\t    Work中提到：\"LayerCast and mixed-precision strategies may reduce precision×item interaction;\n1091\t    validation is ongoing.\"\n1092\t- name: MATH Benchmark Extension\n1093\t  plan_id: exp-008\n1094\t  description: 未完成——P2优先级，依赖exp-002。compute budget不足。\n1095\t  expected_results:\n1096\t    projected_if_completed:\n1097\t      item_id_pct:\n1098\t      - 35\n1099\t      - 42\n1100\t      prompt_x_item_pct:\n1101\t      - 10\n1102\t      - 15\n1103\t      temp_x_item_pct:\n1104\t      - 8\n1105\t      - 14\n1106\t      residual_pct:\n1107\t      - 22\n1108\t      - 30\n1109\t      single_model_G:\n1110\t      - 0.35\n1111\t      - 0.42\n1112\t      reasoning_variance_note: MATH items involve multi-step proofs where chain-of-thought\n1113\t        introduces substantially more stochastic variance than GSM8K. Expected lowest\n1114\t        item_id of all benchmarks and highest temperature sensitivity.\n1115\t  result_rationale: MATH是最强的reasoning benchmark——problems需要multi-step proof而非single-step\n1116\t    arithmetic。 Chain-of-thought在每步引入branching possibilities，使得同一item在不同temperature/prompt下\n1117\t    走完全不同的reasoning path。这将temperature×item和prompt×item推到最高水平， 同时压低item_id。如果完成，MATH将是gradient的第5个点：\n1118\t    MMLU(60%) > HellaSwag(54%) > GSM8K(44%) > ARC(42%) > MATH(~38%)， 可能修复或加剧ARC anomaly。\n1119\t    缺失意味着gradient仅有4个benchmark，statistical power有限。\n1120\t  tables: []\n1121\t  figures_description: []\n1122\t  analysis: exp-008缺失使gradient分析限于4个benchmarks。如果MATH的item_id低于ARC（如projected）， ARC\n1123\t    anomaly会更明显（ARC不在expected位置上），gradient叙事更难成立。 反之，如果MATH的item_id高于ARC，可能重新排列gradient使其更接近monotonic。\n1124\t    无论如何，4个benchmarks已足够支撑\"benchmark-conditional\"的结论—— 不一定需要monotonic gradient，只需要证明variance\n1125\t    structure因benchmark而异。\n1126\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a5e85bec-84c8-44f3-af46-6eebdfb5f517","uuid":"7d2616de-ffa1-426b-8aef-b7315f8d4f6d","timestamp":"2026-05-21T05:53:29.537Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519/projects/nlp_variance_gtheory/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T044739/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: Claims需要校准强度。Claim 1从\"hidden dominant\"降级为\"substantial and previously\n  unquantified\"—— model×item从2-model的26.2%衰减到4-model的16.4%，仍为第二大方差来源但不再可称\"dominant\"。\n  跨benchmark梯度方向大致正确（3/4符合预期）但ARC-Challenge异常打破单调性， 措辞从\"primary novel finding\"降为\"suggestive\n  evidence of benchmark-conditional variance structure\"。 exp-003因第二块GPU未到位而缺失，Claim\n  2必须限定为\"numerical precision on single hardware architecture\"， hardware crossing明确标注为future\n  work。补偿策略：提升Claim 3（IRT vs G-theory 4.1×差距） 为论文第一贡献，因其不受model数量和hardware限制影响；拉入exp-006部分fine-tuning结果\n  展示inference与fine-tuning的方差结构质变（seed取代item成为dominant source）； 强化toolkit的实用价值论证（D-study\n  calculator可直接输出benchmark-specific budget）。 AAAI投稿可行但需精心打磨framing，目标borderline accept（5.5-6.0/10）。\n  最大风险：reviewer质疑\"4 models不够做random facet\"——需在limitations中承认并提供bootstrap补偿。\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: 4-Model Full-Scale MMLU G-Study\n  plan_id: exp-001\n  description: 4 models × 3 precisions (Gemma仅2) × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 3 temperatures\n    × 4 orderings × 200 items。 V0 enforce_eager消除float32 engine confound。完成全部4个模型的数据采集。\n  expected_results:\n    total_records: 890400\n    records_per_model:\n      Llama-3.1-8B: 239200\n      Gemma-2-9B-IT: 172800\n      Mistral-7B-v0.3: 239200\n      Qwen3-8B: 239200\n    overall_accuracy_by_model:\n      Llama: 0.681\n      Gemma: 0.724\n      Mistral: 0.652\n      Qwen: 0.698\n    single_model_item_id_by_model:\n      Llama: 0.611\n      Gemma: 0.583\n      Mistral: 0.624\n      Qwen: 0.568\n    single_model_item_id_mean: 0.597\n    single_model_G_by_model:\n      Llama: 0.611\n      Gemma: 0.583\n      Mistral: 0.628\n      Qwen: 0.571\n    single_model_G_mean: 0.598\n    cross_model_4model:\n      item_id_pct: 41.2\n      model_pct: 6.8\n      model_x_item_pct: 16.4\n      precision_pct: 1.5\n      temperature_pct: 1.0\n      prompt_x_item_pct: 3.8\n      seed_x_item_pct: 3.5\n      precision_x_item_pct: 3.2\n      temp_x_item_pct: 2.4\n      ordering_x_item_pct: 1.2\n      model_x_precision_pct: 0.8\n      model_x_prompt_pct: 0.4\n      model_x_temperature_pct: 0.3\n      other_interactions_pct: 2.8\n      residual_pct: 14.7\n    cross_model_G_all_random: 0.152\n    cross_model_G_practical: 0.198\n    d_study_cross_model:\n      items_200_G: 0.152\n      items_400_G: 0.245\n      items_600_G: 0.312\n      items_1000_G: 0.408\n      models_10_items_200_G: 0.228\n    d_study_single_model_Llama:\n      items_200_G: 0.611\n      items_414_G_practical: 0.8\n      items_510_G_all_random: 0.8\n    infra_x_method_binary_pct: 0.08\n    precision_x_temperature_text_exact_pct: 1.4\n  result_rationale: 2-model分析（Llama vs Gemma）捕获了一个特别极端的model×item交互（26.2%）， 因为这两个模型在训练数据组成和架构上差异最大（Llama=Meta训练、Gemma=Google训练）。\n    加入Mistral（与Llama架构类似的decoder-only）和Qwen（与Gemma竞争力相当的中文-英文模型）后， 4模型的model×item交互被\"稀释\"——Mistral与Llama在item难度排序上部分冗余，\n    Qwen与Gemma也有重叠，使得极端的成对item-level不一致被平均化。 model×item从26.2%衰减到16.4%反映了：(a) 2-model是upper\n    bound而非point estimate， (b) 4 models覆盖了更均匀的架构空间，降低了极端成对差异的权重。 然而16.4%仍然是第二大方差源（仅次于item_id的41.2%），确认model×item是真实效应而非2-model\n    artifact。 cross-model G从0.073上升到0.152——方向正确但仍远低于0.80阈值， 说明即使4模型的\"缓冲\"效应，item难度排序的模型特异性仍然是跨模型可推广性的根本障碍。\n    D-study显示即使10个模型也只能达到G=0.228——model×item交互不能通过增加模型数量有效消除， 这是因为每个新模型带来新的item-level\n    disagreement pattern。\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table 1: Per-Model Single-Facet Variance Decomposition (%, binary correct,\n      MMLU 200 items)'\n    columns:\n    - Component\n    - Llama\n    - Gemma\n    - Mistral\n    - Qwen\n    - Mean\n    rows:\n    - - item_id\n      - 61.1\n      - 58.3\n      - 62.4\n      - 56.8\n      - 59.7\n    - - precision\n      - 2.5\n      - 1.2\n      - 2.8\n      - 1.9\n      - 2.1\n    - - temperature\n      - 1.8\n      - 1.6\n      - 1.5\n      - 2.0\n      - 1.7\n    - - prompt_x_item\n      - 4.6\n      - 5.1\n      - 3.8\n      - 5.5\n      - 4.8\n    - - seed_x_item\n      - 4.7\n      - 4.2\n      - 5.1\n      - 4.4\n      - 4.6\n    - - precision_x_item\n      - 5.2\n      - 4.0\n      - 4.8\n      - 5.8\n      - 5.0\n    - - temp_x_item\n      - 3.2\n      - 3.8\n      - 2.9\n      - 4.2\n      - 3.5\n    - - ordering_x_item\n      - 1.2\n      - 1.5\n      - 1.0\n      - 1.4\n      - 1.3\n    - - other\n      - 2.8\n      - 2.9\n      - 2.5\n      - 2.6\n      - 2.7\n    - - residual\n      - 12.9\n      - 17.4\n      - 13.2\n      - 15.4\n      - 14.7\n  - title: 'Table 2: 4-Model Crossed Variance Decomposition (%, binary correct, model\n      as random facet)'\n    columns:\n    - Component\n    - Pct\n    - Interpretation\n    rows:\n    - - item_id\n      - 41.2\n      - largest source but reduced 18.5pp from single-model mean\n    - - model\n      - 6.8\n      - between-model mean accuracy differences\n    - - model_x_item\n      - 16.4\n      - second-largest; item difficulty rankings are model-specific\n    - - precision_x_item\n      - 3.2\n      - precision effects are item-conditional\n    - - prompt_x_item\n      - 3.8\n      - prompt sensitivity varies across items\n    - - seed_x_item\n      - 3.5\n      - seed variance is item-conditional\n    - - temp_x_item\n      - 2.4\n      - temperature sensitivity varies across items\n    - - precision\n      - 1.5\n      - aggregate precision effect\n    - - ordering_x_item\n      - 1.2\n      - ordering effects are item-conditional\n    - - temperature\n      - 1.0\n      - aggregate temperature effect\n    - - model_x_precision\n      - 0.8\n      - models respond differently to precision\n    - - model_x_prompt\n      - 0.4\n      - models respond differently to prompts\n    - - model_x_temperature\n      - 0.3\n      - models respond differently to temperature\n    - - other_interactions\n      - 2.8\n      - higher-order and remaining 2-way\n    - - residual\n      - 14.7\n      - unexplained + higher-order confounded\n  - title: 'Table 3: Model Accuracy by Precision (%, MMLU 200 items, T=0.0 average)'\n    columns:\n    - Model\n    - BF16\n    - FP16\n    - FP32\n    - Mean\n    rows:\n    - - Llama-3.1-8B\n      - 71.1\n      - 71.1\n      - 60.4\n      - 67.5\n    - - Gemma-2-9B-IT\n      - 74.8\n      - N/A\n      - 67.2\n      - 71.0\n    - - Mistral-7B-v0.3\n      - 67.8\n      - 68.0\n      - 58.5\n      - 64.8\n    - - Qwen3-8B\n      - 72.4\n      - 72.2\n      - 64.1\n      - 69.6\n  - title: 'Table 4: D-Study Projections — Cross-Model G by Items and Models'\n    columns:\n    - n_models\n    - n_items_200\n    - n_items_400\n    - n_items_600\n    - n_items_1000\n    rows:\n    - - 4 (all random)\n      - 0.152\n      - 0.245\n      - 0.312\n      - 0.408\n    - - 4 (practical)\n      - 0.198\n      - 0.308\n      - 0.382\n      - 0.478\n    - - 10 (all random)\n      - 0.228\n      - 0.351\n      - 0.432\n      - 0.538\n    - - 20 (all random)\n      - 0.289\n      - 0.425\n      - 0.508\n      - 0.612\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 1 (Reveal figure): 并排堆叠条形图——左：single-model平均方差分解（item_id=59.7%主导）， 右：4-model\n    crossed方差分解（item_id=41.2%缩小，model×item=16.4%出现为第二大源）。 视觉上清晰展示model facet引入后item_id的18.5pp下降和model×item的\"涌现\"。'\n  - 'Figure supplement: D-study曲线——G vs n_items for different n_models (4, 10, 20)，\n    标注G=0.80阈值线。所有曲线在可行范围内均未达到0.80， 直观展示model×item交互对跨模型可推广性的\"不可消除\"限制。'\n  analysis: 核心发现：4-model分析确认model×item交互是真实效应而非2-model artifact，但效应量从26.2%衰减到16.4%。\n    这意味着Claim 1的措辞需要从\"hidden dominant\"调整为\"substantial and previously unquantified\"。\n    论文叙事应强调：(a) 16.4%仍然大于precision(1.5%)、temperature(1.0%)和所有prompt/seed效应的总和， 使其成为\"next\n    largest source after item selection\"； (b) cross-model G仍然远低于0.80，实际含义不变——单模型G-study给出虚假的可靠性信心；\n    (c) D-study显示模型数量无法有效补偿model×item——20个模型×1000个items才达到G=0.612。 需要承认的limitation：4个模型作为random\n    facet的degrees of freedom有限， model×item的16.4%估计可能有较宽CI（bootstrap分析见exp-004）。\n- name: Item Resampling Stability Test\n  plan_id: exp-001b\n  description: 3个独立的200-item stratified样本（seed 0/7/99）× Llama × 3 precisions × 3 prompts\n    × 3 seeds × 2 orderings。 测试item_id主导性是否为特定item样本的artifact。\n  expected_results:\n    total_records_per_sample: 10800\n    conditions_per_sample: 54\n    sample_0_item_id_pct: 61.1\n    sample_7_item_id_pct: 49.3\n    sample_99_item_id_pct: 57.8\n    item_id_mean: 56.1\n    item_id_std: 6.1\n    item_id_cv: 0.13\n    sample_0_G: 0.614\n    sample_7_G: 0.498\n    sample_99_G: 0.581\n    G_mean: 0.564\n    G_cv: 0.11\n    prompt_x_item_cv: 0.22\n    seed_x_item_cv: 0.19\n    precision_x_item_cv: 0.25\n    item_overlap_across_samples:\n      top_50_hardest_jaccard: 0.38\n      top_50_easiest_jaccard: 0.45\n  result_rationale: MMLU包含约14K items，200-item stratified样本只覆盖~1.4%的item universe。\n    不同样本抽到不同的难度分布、学科覆盖和区分度组合，导致item_id估计存在中等变异。 sample_7（seed=7）的item_id最低（49.3%），因为该样本偶然包含了更多中等难度items\n    （p(correct)接近0.5区间的items更集中），使得Bernoulli方差p(1-p)在items间更均匀， 减少了item间的方差比例。sample_0保留了原始分析的61.1%因为使用了相同的stratification\n    seed。 CV=0.13意味着如果换一组items，item_id可能在~49-63%之间波动—— headline claim需要以区间（\"55-65%\"）而非单点给出。\n    top-50 hardest items的Jaccard仅0.38，说明哪些items\"最难\"本身就是样本依赖的， 进一步证实item-level结论需要resampling验证。\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table 5: Item Resampling Stability — Variance Decomposition Across 3 Samples'\n    columns:\n    - Component\n    - Sample_0\n    - Sample_7\n    - Sample_99\n    - Mean\n    - SD\n    - CV\n    rows:\n    - - item_id\n      - 61.1\n      - 49.3\n      - 57.8\n      - 56.1\n      - 6.1\n      - 0.13\n    - - precision\n      - 2.5\n      - 3.1\n      - 2.7\n      - 2.8\n      - 0.3\n      - 0.11\n    - - prompt_x_item\n      - 4.6\n      - 6.2\n      - 5.1\n      - 5.3\n      - 0.8\n      - 0.22\n    - - seed_x_item\n      - 4.7\n      - 5.8\n      - 5.0\n      - 5.2\n      - 0.6\n      - 0.19\n    - - precision_x_item\n      - 5.2\n      - 7.5\n      - 5.8\n      - 6.2\n      - 1.2\n      - 0.25\n    - - temp_x_item\n      - 3.2\n      - 4.0\n      - 3.5\n      - 3.6\n      - 0.4\n      - 0.11\n    - - residual\n      - 12.9\n      - 16.8\n      - 14.2\n      - 14.6\n      - 2.0\n      - 0.14\n  - title: 'Table 6: G-Coefficient Stability Across Item Samples'\n    columns:\n    - Metric\n    - Sample_0\n    - Sample_7\n    - Sample_99\n    - Mean\n    - CV\n    rows:\n    - - G (binary, practical)\n      - 0.614\n      - 0.498\n      - 0.581\n      - 0.564\n      - 0.11\n    - - G (binary, all random)\n      - 0.591\n      - 0.472\n      - 0.558\n      - 0.54\n      - 0.11\n    - - Items for G≥0.80 (practical)\n      - 410\n      - 586\n      - 462\n      - 486\n      - 0.19\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Forest plot: 3个item样本的item_id点估计 + 95% bootstrap CI， 标注overall mean和CV。展示中等变异性——置信区间有交叉但非完全重叠。'\n  analysis: CV=0.13表明item_id主导性对item选择有中等敏感性，但方向一致——所有3个样本中item_id均为最大方差源。 论文需要：(a)\n    以区间而非单点报告item_id（\"55-65% across item resamples\"）， (b) 讨论sample_7的49.3%为何偏低（item难度分布更均匀），\n    (c) 将resampling CV纳入D-study推算的不确定性。 对headline claim的影响：不改变定性结论（item dominance成立），但定量精度降低。\n- name: Multi-Benchmark Replication (GSM8K, ARC, HellaSwag)\n  plan_id: exp-002\n  description: 4 models × BF16/FP16 × 6 prompts × 6 seeds × 2 temperatures × 4 orderings\n    × 200 items on GSM8K, ARC-Challenge, HellaSwag。Gemma使用BF16/FP32替代BF16/FP16。 测试跨benchmark方差梯度。\n  expected_results:\n    total_records: 1382400\n    records_per_benchmark: 460800\n    conditions_per_model_per_benchmark: 576\n    benchmark_results:\n      MMLU:\n        accuracy_mean: 0.689\n        item_id_pct: 59.7\n        prompt_x_item_pct: 4.8\n        seed_x_item_pct: 4.6\n        temp_x_item_pct: 3.5\n        precision_x_item_pct: 5.0\n        residual_pct: 14.7\n        single_model_G: 0.598\n        cross_model_G: 0.152\n        model_x_item_pct: 16.4\n        infra_x_method_binary_pct: 0.08\n      HellaSwag:\n        accuracy_mean: 0.635\n        item_id_pct: 54.2\n        prompt_x_item_pct: 5.8\n        seed_x_item_pct: 4.1\n        temp_x_item_pct: 4.5\n        precision_x_item_pct: 3.8\n        residual_pct: 17.2\n        single_model_G: 0.548\n        cross_model_G: 0.186\n        model_x_item_pct: 13.8\n        infra_x_method_binary_pct: 0.15\n      ARC_Challenge:\n        accuracy_mean: 0.553\n        item_id_pct: 41.8\n        prompt_x_item_pct: 10.5\n        seed_x_item_pct: 5.2\n        temp_x_item_pct: 5.8\n        precision_x_item_pct: 4.2\n        residual_pct: 21.5\n        single_model_G: 0.421\n        cross_model_G: 0.108\n        model_x_item_pct: 19.5\n        infra_x_method_binary_pct: 0.42\n      GSM8K:\n        accuracy_mean: 0.443\n        item_id_pct: 43.5\n        prompt_x_item_pct: 8.9\n        seed_x_item_pct: 5.5\n        temp_x_item_pct: 7.2\n        precision_x_item_pct: 3.6\n        residual_pct: 22.8\n        single_model_G: 0.438\n        cross_model_G: 0.125\n        model_x_item_pct: 18.1\n        infra_x_method_binary_pct: 0.65\n    gradient:\n      item_id_order_observed:\n      - MMLU\n      - HellaSwag\n      - GSM8K\n      - ARC_Challenge\n      item_id_order_expected:\n      - MMLU\n      - HellaSwag\n      - ARC_Challenge\n      - GSM8K\n      anomalous_benchmark: ARC_Challenge\n      anomaly_direction: ARC item_id异常偏低（41.8% vs 预期>GSM8K的43.5%）\n      item_id_spread_pp: 17.9\n      gradient_rank_correlation: 0.8\n    separability_binary:\n      MMLU: 0.08\n      HellaSwag: 0.15\n      ARC_Challenge: 0.42\n      GSM8K: 0.65\n  result_rationale: 跨benchmark梯度反映了不同任务类型的item难度变异结构差异。 MMLU（知识检索）item_id最高（59.7%）：因为factual\n    knowledge items的难度 在条件变化下高度稳定——一个化学知识要么知道要么不知道，prompt措辞影响有限。 HellaSwag（常识NLI）item_id次高（54.2%）：commonsense\n    completion的难度相对稳定， 但prompt format对NLI-style items有一定影响。 GSM8K（数学推理）item_id=43.5%：chain-of-thought推理引入更多随机性——\n    同一道数学题在不同temperature/prompt下可能走不同推理路径， 增加了temperature×item和prompt×item的方差份额。 ARC-Challenge（科学推理）item_id异常偏低（41.8%）：这是anomaly。\n    原因可能是ARC的科学题目对prompt措辞特别敏感（prompt×item=10.5%，远高于其他benchmark的4-6%）， 因为scientific\n    reasoning items的选项描述更复杂，措辞变化直接改变推理路径。 ARC的prompt sensitivity\"吸收\"了本应归属item_id的方差，导致item_id被压低。\n    分离性随task complexity增加而降低（MMLU=0.08% → GSM8K=0.65%）， 但所有benchmark的binary infra×method交互均<1%，confirming\n    separability在binary scoring下成立。\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table 7: Cross-Benchmark Variance Decomposition (%, single-model average,\n      binary correct)'\n    columns:\n    - Component\n    - MMLU\n    - HellaSwag\n    - ARC\n    - GSM8K\n    rows:\n    - - item_id\n      - 59.7\n      - 54.2\n      - 41.8\n      - 43.5\n    - - prompt_x_item\n      - 4.8\n      - 5.8\n      - 10.5\n      - 8.9\n    - - seed_x_item\n      - 4.6\n      - 4.1\n      - 5.2\n      - 5.5\n    - - temp_x_item\n      - 3.5\n      - 4.5\n      - 5.8\n      - 7.2\n    - - precision_x_item\n      - 5.0\n      - 3.8\n      - 4.2\n      - 3.6\n    - - ordering_x_item\n      - 1.3\n      - 2.2\n      - 1.8\n      - 1.2\n    - - precision\n      - 2.1\n      - 1.8\n      - 2.5\n      - 1.5\n    - - temperature\n      - 1.7\n      - 2.4\n      - 2.7\n      - 3.0\n    - - other\n      - 2.6\n      - 3.8\n      - 4.0\n      - 4.0\n    - - residual\n      - 14.7\n      - 17.2\n      - 21.5\n      - 22.8\n  - title: 'Table 8: Cross-Benchmark Gradient Summary'\n    columns:\n    - Benchmark\n    - TaskType\n    - item_id_pct\n    - single_G\n    - cross_model_G\n    - model_x_item_pct\n    - separability_pct\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - knowledge\n      - 59.7\n      - 0.598\n      - 0.152\n      - 16.4\n      - 0.08\n    - - HellaSwag\n      - commonsense\n      - 54.2\n      - 0.548\n      - 0.186\n      - 13.8\n      - 0.15\n    - - GSM8K\n      - math_reasoning\n      - 43.5\n      - 0.438\n      - 0.125\n      - 18.1\n      - 0.65\n    - - ARC-Challenge*\n      - science_reasoning\n      - 41.8\n      - 0.421\n      - 0.108\n      - 19.5\n      - 0.42\n    note: '* ARC-Challenge为anomalous benchmark：item_id低于GSM8K，打破expected gradient'\n  - title: 'Table 9: Per-Benchmark D-Study — Items for G≥0.80 (single-model, practical)'\n    columns:\n    - Benchmark\n    - items_G80_practical\n    - items_G80_all_random\n    - current_G_200items\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - 414\n      - 510\n      - 0.598\n    - - HellaSwag\n      - 488\n      - 612\n      - 0.548\n    - - ARC-Challenge\n      - 682\n      - 845\n      - 0.421\n    - - GSM8K\n      - 648\n      - 798\n      - 0.438\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Stacked bar chart: 4 benchmarks并排展示方差分解，item_id用深蓝色突出。 MMLU的深蓝色最高（59.7%），GSM8K和ARC最低（~42-44%），\n    prompt×item（橙色）在ARC中异常突出。标注anomaly注释。'\n  - 'Scatter plot: x轴=task complexity ordinal（knowledge→commonsense→science→math），\n    y轴=item_id%。标注expected monotonic gradient线和observed values。 ARC点明显偏离趋势线。'\n  analysis: 梯度方向大致正确（知识任务item_id最高，推理任务最低），但ARC的异常打破了单调性。 对论文叙事的影响：不能使用\"systematic\n    gradient\"或\"monotonic decrease\"—— 改为\"suggestive evidence of benchmark-conditional\n    variance structure\"， 并专门讨论ARC异常的原因（prompt sensitivity absorbing item variance）。\n    积极方面：跨benchmark的separability一致低于1%（binary），confirming Claim 2的核心结论。 D-study预算因benchmark而异（414-682\n    items for G≥0.80），证明universal budget不可行—— 这本身是一个有价值的finding。\n- name: Multi-Hardware G-Study\n  plan_id: exp-003\n  description: 第二块GPU未到位（Manager审批延迟 + 云GPU成本超预算）。 仅有westd-32570 (RTX PRO 6000) 上的precision变异数据，\n    与exp-001完全冗余——无法计算hardware × methodology交互。\n  expected_results:\n    completion_pct: 0\n    usable_data_beyond_exp001: none\n    hardware_types_available: 1\n    hardware_x_methodology_computable: false\n    precision_x_methodology_from_exp001: available\n    planned_records: 1382400\n    actual_records: 0\n  result_rationale: exp-003的核心价值是hardware crossing——测试不同GPU架构对方差结构的影响。 无第二种GPU，所有数据均来自同一RTX\n    PRO 6000，precision变异已由exp-001完整覆盖。 不存在\"部分完成\"——hardware facet要么有crossing，要么没有。\n    没有crossing意味着infrastructure facet在论文中只能被定义为\"numerical precision on single hardware\"，\n    hardware × methodology交互完全缺失。 这是median scenario的最大单一gap——直接影响Claim 2的scope和可信度。\n    Reviewer极可能质疑：\"如果只测了一种GPU上的precision变化，你的separability结论能推广到什么范围？\"\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: exp-003缺失迫使Claim 2重新定义。原measures：\"infrastructure × methodology separability\"\n    变为\"numerical precision × methodology separability on a single GPU architecture\n    (RTX PRO 6000)\"。 论文需要：(a) 将hardware crossing明确标注为future work， (b) 引用Yuan et al.\n    (2025)的multi-GPU结果作为间接支持， (c) 在limitations中承认：\"我们的separability结论限于precision facet；\n    GPU架构差异可能引入额外的hardware × item交互，这需要后续研究验证。\" 对AAAI投稿的影响：Claim 2从\"confirmatory with\n    novel infrastructure crossing\" 降级为\"confirmatory on a subset of infrastructure\n    dimensions\"。 影响可控——separability本身就被定位为confirmatory finding而非primary novelty。\n- name: Comprehensive Analysis of Combined Data\n  plan_id: exp-004\n  description: 整合exp-001/001b/002数据（exp-003缺失）的全面分析。 包含model-as-facet、bootstrap CIs、D-study、IRT对比等17个子分析。\n  expected_results:\n    data_sources:\n    - exp-001\n    - exp-001b\n    - exp-002\n    missing_data: exp-003\n    model_as_facet:\n      model_x_item_pct: 16.4\n      cross_model_G: 0.152\n    bootstrap_CIs_95pct:\n      item_id:\n      - 36.8\n      - 45.6\n      model:\n      - 3.2\n      - 10.4\n      model_x_item:\n      - 11.2\n      - 21.8\n      precision:\n      - 0.6\n      - 2.4\n      prompt_x_item:\n      - 2.4\n      - 5.2\n      seed_x_item:\n      - 2.1\n      - 4.9\n      precision_x_item:\n      - 1.8\n      - 4.6\n      temp_x_item:\n      - 1.2\n      - 3.6\n      infra_x_method:\n      - 0.0\n      - 0.4\n      residual:\n      - 11.5\n      - 17.9\n    d_study_G80:\n      MMLU_practical:\n        point: 414\n        CI_95:\n        - 352\n        - 498\n      MMLU_all_random:\n        point: 510\n        CI_95:\n        - 428\n        - 618\n      HellaSwag_practical:\n        point: 488\n        CI_95:\n        - 405\n        - 592\n      ARC_practical:\n        point: 682\n        CI_95:\n        - 558\n        - 838\n      GSM8K_practical:\n        point: 648\n        CI_95:\n        - 532\n        - 792\n    reml_vs_henderson_max_diff_pct: 1.8\n    logprob_item_id_pct: 52.4\n    logprob_G: 0.528\n    logprob_note: item_id lower than binary (52.4% vs 59.7%) because logprob captures\n      partial knowledge\n    irt_vs_gtheory:\n      MMLU:\n        irt_items_recommended: 116\n        gtheory_items_G80_practical: 414\n        ratio: 3.6\n        gtheory_G_at_116_items: 0.489\n        gap_attribution:\n          prompt_x_item_pct: 4.8\n          seed_x_item_pct: 4.6\n          ordering_x_item_pct: 1.3\n          residual_pct: 14.7\n      HellaSwag:\n        irt_items_recommended: 108\n        gtheory_items_G80_practical: 488\n        ratio: 4.5\n        gtheory_G_at_108_items: 0.442\n      ARC:\n        irt_items_recommended: 98\n        gtheory_items_G80_practical: 682\n        ratio: 7.0\n        gtheory_G_at_98_items: 0.352\n      GSM8K:\n        irt_items_recommended: 105\n        gtheory_items_G80_practical: 648\n        ratio: 6.2\n        gtheory_G_at_105_items: 0.372\n      mean_ratio: 4.1\n    power_analysis:\n      design_scale: 5184 conditions × 200 items per benchmark\n      detectable_interaction_pct: 0.5\n      power_at_1pct_interaction: 0.99\n      power_at_0.3pct_interaction: 0.92\n    fixed_vs_random:\n      temp_fixed_G_change: 0.032\n      ordering_fixed_G_change: 0.018\n      max_variance_shift_pct: 3.2\n      conclusion: robust (<5% threshold)\n    binary_data:\n      bernoulli_correlation_r: 0.38\n      bernoulli_p_value: <0.001\n      obs_over_bernoulli_ratio: 1.0008\n      null_sim_item_id_pct: 0.08\n      observed_item_id_pct: 59.7\n      inflation_factor: 746.3\n    bootstrap_vs_jackknife:\n      CI_width_ratio_range:\n      - 0.94\n      - 1.08\n      mean_ratio: 1.01\n      conclusion: independence violation negligible\n    design_asymmetry:\n      MMLU_3x3_item_id: 59.7\n      MMLU_2x2_matched_item_id: 58.9\n      max_component_change_pct: 2.1\n      conclusion: robust to design reduction\n    full_benchmark:\n      MMLU_14K_items_G_practical: 0.942\n      MMLU_14K_items_G_all_random: 0.871\n    gpu_cost:\n      cost_per_G80_MMLU_practical_usd: 12.5\n      cost_per_G80_ARC_practical_usd: 28.4\n      note: based on A100-80GB cloud pricing at $2.50/hr\n  result_rationale: Bootstrap CIs揭示了4-model分析的核心不确定性：model×item的CI为[11.2, 21.8]， 宽度10.6pp，这是因为只有4个models作为model\n    facet的levels，degrees of freedom极低。 这意味着model×item的真实值可能低至11.2%（接近\"non-dominant\"）或高至21.8%（接近\"dominant\"）。\n    CI的宽度本身就是一个finding——它说明4个models不足以精确估计model×item。 IRT vs G-theory对比是最稳健的分析（不依赖model\n    facet），MMLU上的3.6×差距 直接归因于prompt×item(4.8%), seed×item(4.6%), ordering×item(1.3%)和residual(14.7%)——\n    这些维度是IRT完全忽略的。跨benchmark的ratio从3.6×（MMLU）增加到7.0×（ARC）， 因为reasoning tasks的prompt/seed\n    sensitivity更高，使G-theory和IRT的gap进一步扩大。 Fixed vs random sensitivity分析确认facet分类对方差分解影响<5%，\n    这是对MD2审稿问题的直接回答。 Bernoulli correlation r=0.38意味着item_id中约14%的变异（r²=0.14）可归因于Bernoulli\n    p(1-p)—— 这是non-trivial但不dominant的mechanical link，大部分item方差反映了真实的item difficulty异质性。\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table 10: Bootstrap 95% CIs for MMLU 4-Model Variance Components (%)'\n    columns:\n    - Component\n    - Point_Est\n    - CI_Low\n    - CI_High\n    - CI_Width\n    rows:\n    - - item_id\n      - 41.2\n      - 36.8\n      - 45.6\n      - 8.8\n    - - model\n      - 6.8\n      - 3.2\n      - 10.4\n      - 7.2\n    - - model_x_item\n      - 16.4\n      - 11.2\n      - 21.8\n      - 10.6\n    - - precision\n      - 1.5\n      - 0.6\n      - 2.4\n      - 1.8\n    - - prompt_x_item\n      - 3.8\n      - 2.4\n      - 5.2\n      - 2.8\n    - - seed_x_item\n      - 3.5\n      - 2.1\n      - 4.9\n      - 2.8\n    - - precision_x_item\n      - 3.2\n      - 1.8\n      - 4.6\n      - 2.8\n    - - temp_x_item\n      - 2.4\n      - 1.2\n      - 3.6\n      - 2.4\n    - - infra_x_method\n      - 0.08\n      - 0.0\n      - 0.4\n      - 0.4\n    - - residual\n      - 14.7\n      - 11.5\n      - 17.9\n      - 6.4\n  - title: 'Table 11: IRT vs G-theory Item Requirements for G≥0.80'\n    columns:\n    - Benchmark\n    - IRT_items\n    - Gtheory_items_practical\n    - Ratio\n    - Gtheory_G_at_IRT_items\n    rows:\n    - - MMLU\n      - 116\n      - 414\n      - 3.6×\n      - 0.489\n    - - HellaSwag\n      - 108\n      - 488\n      - 4.5×\n      - 0.442\n    - - GSM8K\n      - 105\n      - 648\n      - 6.2×\n      - 0.372\n    - - ARC-Challenge\n      - 98\n      - 682\n      - 7.0×\n      - 0.352\n    - - Mean\n      - 107\n      - 558\n      - 4.1×(MMLU/Hella), 5.3×(all)\n  - title: 'Table 12: Methodological Defense Summary'\n    columns:\n    - Defense\n    - Analysis\n    - Result\n    - Conclusion\n    rows:\n    - - MD1\n      - Bernoulli correlation\n      - r=0.38, r²=0.14\n      - partial mechanical link, not dominant\n    - - MD2\n      - Fixed vs random\n      - max shift 3.2%\n      - robust (<5%)\n    - - MD5\n      - Full MMLU projection\n      - 14K items → G=0.942\n      - subsampling is the cost, not MMLU flaw\n    - - MD6\n      - Bootstrap vs jackknife\n      - ratio 0.94-1.08\n      - independence violation negligible\n    - - MD8\n      - 3×3 vs 2×2 matched\n      - max change 2.1%\n      - robust to design reduction\n    - - MD9\n      - Logprob scoring\n      - item_id=52.4%, G=0.528\n      - consistent direction, lower magnitude\n  - title: 'Table 13: D-Study Budget — Items × Prompts × Seeds for Target G (MMLU,\n      practical)'\n    columns:\n    - Target_G\n    - Items\n    - Prompts\n    - Seeds\n    - Total_Conditions\n    rows:\n    - - 0.8\n      - 414\n      - 1\n      - 1\n      - 414\n    - - 0.8\n      - 280\n      - 2\n      - 2\n      - 1120\n    - - 0.9\n      - 685\n      - 1\n      - 1\n      - 685\n    - - 0.9\n      - 420\n      - 2\n      - 3\n      - 2520\n    - - 0.95\n      - 1050\n      - 1\n      - 1\n      - 1050\n    - - 0.95\n      - 610\n      - 3\n      - 3\n      - 5490\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Figure 3: D-study projection curves — G vs item count for MMLU。 两条曲线：practical（precision+temp\n    fixed）和all-random。 标注G=0.80 threshold和IRT推荐的116 items处的G值（0.489）。 标注差距区域（116→414\n    items）并label为\"cost of multi-facet reliability\"。'\n  - 'Figure 4: IRT vs G-theory bar chart — 4 benchmarks并排， 每个benchmark两个bar（IRT items\n    vs G-theory items），ratio标注在bar上方。 高亮MMLU的3.6×到ARC的7.0×渐变，说明gap因benchmark而异。'\n  - 'Figure 5: Bootstrap CI forest plot — 所有方差组件的点估计 + 95% CI， model×item的CI跨越\"substantial\"和\"moderate\"区域。'\n  analysis: exp-004是论文的analytical backbone。最关键的三个outputs： (1) IRT vs G-theory的4.1×差距成为论文最强claim——不受model数量限制，\n    统计power充足，跨benchmark一致（3.6-7.0×），且有清晰的causal attribution （prompt/seed/ordering维度IRT完全忽略）。建议提升为Contribution\n    1。 (2) Bootstrap CIs量化了model×item估计的不确定性——CI width 10.6pp 意味着论文不能声称\"precisely\n    16.4%\"，需使用\"approximately 12-22%\"。 (3) D-study预算表是toolkit的核心deliverable——直接给出benchmark-specific的\n    items × prompts × seeds组合和对应的expected G，填补了practical guidance的空白。\n- name: 14B Model Extension\n  plan_id: exp-005\n  description: 未完成——需要第二种GPU（≥48GB VRAM）且依赖exp-003。 提供projected results用于论文Discussion中的future\n    work section。\n  expected_results:\n    projected_if_completed:\n      models:\n      - Qwen3-14B\n      - DeepSeek-R1-Distill-14B\n      item_id_range_pct:\n      - 52\n      - 62\n      model_x_item_change: potentially reduced by 2-4pp due to larger model capacity\n      scale_effect_hypothesis: 14B models may show lower model×item because larger\n        capacity enables more consistent item-level patterns across architectures.\n        Alternatively, specialized training (DeepSeek R1 distillation) could increase\n        model×item by creating architecture-specific item shortcuts.\n  result_rationale: 未执行因hardware constraint和dependency chain（exp-003→exp-005）。 即使有GPU，14B模型的推理时间约为8B的2-3×，120\n    GPU hours可能不够覆盖full design。 Projected results基于scale-accuracy关系的文献推断： larger models通常在更多items上达到高准确率，这可能降低item-level\n    variance （更多items接近p=1.0，Bernoulli variance减少）。 但DeepSeek-R1-Distill的reasoning-specific训练可能创造独特的item\n    difficulty profile， 增加model×item interaction。两种效应可能部分抵消。\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: exp-005缺失意味着scale-dependent结论无法做出。 论文需在limitations中声明：\"our findings are\n    limited to 7-9B parameter models; whether model×item interaction scales with model\n    size is an open question.\" 这是可接受的scope limitation——大多数evaluation methodology papers不做scale\n    analysis。\n- name: Fine-Tuning G-Study (RoBERTa, Partial)\n  plan_id: exp-006\n  description: 完成2/4 tasks（SST-2, MNLI）。仅1 GPU（非计划的3 GPU）。 6 seeds × 3 LRs × 4 data\n    shuffles × 1 GPU × 2 precisions = 144 runs/task。 288 total runs（计划1728的16.7%）。\n  expected_results:\n    tasks_completed:\n    - SST-2\n    - MNLI\n    tasks_missing:\n    - RTE\n    - COPA\n    total_runs: 288\n    completion_pct: 16.7\n    gpu_facet_missing: true\n    SST2_variance_decomposition:\n      seed_pct: 31.5\n      learning_rate_pct: 22.3\n      data_shuffle_pct: 8.7\n      precision_pct: 2.4\n      seed_x_lr_pct: 6.2\n      seed_x_shuffle_pct: 3.8\n      lr_x_shuffle_pct: 4.1\n      precision_x_seed_pct: 1.5\n      other_pct: 2.8\n      residual_pct: 16.7\n    SST2_G_coefficient: 0.42\n    SST2_accuracy_mean: 0.938\n    SST2_accuracy_std: 0.008\n    MNLI_variance_decomposition:\n      seed_pct: 28.9\n      learning_rate_pct: 25.1\n      data_shuffle_pct: 11.2\n      precision_pct: 1.8\n      seed_x_lr_pct: 7.4\n      seed_x_shuffle_pct: 4.2\n      lr_x_shuffle_pct: 3.5\n      precision_x_seed_pct: 1.2\n      other_pct: 2.9\n      residual_pct: 13.8\n    MNLI_G_coefficient: 0.38\n    MNLI_accuracy_mean: 0.871\n    MNLI_accuracy_std: 0.012\n    inference_vs_finetuning_comparison:\n      dominant_source_inference: item_id (55-65%)\n      dominant_source_finetuning: seed (29-32%)\n      second_source_inference: model×item (12-20%) or residual\n      second_source_finetuning: learning_rate (22-25%)\n      qualitative_shift: fundamentally different variance hierarchies\n  result_rationale: Fine-tuning与inference的方差结构质变源于根本机制差异。 Inference中item是唯一变化的measurement\n    occasion——模型参数固定， 所以item difficulty heterogeneity主导方差。 Fine-tuning中模型参数本身在每次run中不同（seed决定initialization和optimizer\n    trajectory）， 使seed成为dominant source。Learning rate控制optimization aggressiveness——\n    高LR可能跳过细粒度pattern，低LR可能陷入不同local minima， 两者都导致最终模型在item level上的behavior差异。 Data\n    shuffle影响training order exposure，MNLI（多分类，131K训练样本）比SST-2 （二分类，67K样本）更敏感于data\n    ordering（11.2% vs 8.7%）， 因为更大更复杂的训练集使得不同shuffle暴露不同的data pattern。 Precision在fine-tuning中影响小（1.8-2.4%）因为gradient\n    accumulation平滑了numerical差异。 G=0.38-0.42意味着fine-tuning的reproducibility比inference更差——\n    即使固定learning rate和data，6个seeds产生的模型不够reliable。\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table 14: Inference vs Fine-Tuning Variance Hierarchy Comparison (%)'\n    columns:\n    - Rank\n    - Inference_Source\n    - Inference_Pct\n    - Finetuning_Source\n    - Finetuning_Pct\n    rows:\n    - - 1\n      - item_id\n      - 55-65\n      - seed\n      - 29-32\n    - - 2\n      - residual\n      - 13-23\n      - learning_rate\n      - 22-25\n    - - 3\n      - precision×item\n      - 3-6\n      - data_shuffle\n      - 9-11\n    - - 4\n      - prompt×item\n      - 4-6\n      - seed×lr\n      - 6-7\n    - - 5\n      - seed×item\n      - 4-5\n      - lr×shuffle\n      - 4-5\n    note: Inference values averaged across 4 models on MMLU; fine-tuning averaged\n      across SST-2/MNLI\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Paired stacked bar: inference（左）vs fine-tuning（右）方差分解， 用颜色映射展示方差hierarchy的质变——inference中item_id的深蓝色主导，\n    fine-tuning中seed的红色主导。直观展示\"不同evaluation阶段的reproducibility瓶颈不同\"。'\n  analysis: '部分fine-tuning结果的最大价值是展示\"方差hierarchy的阶段依赖性\"—— inference和fine-tuning面对完全不同的reproducibility瓶颈。\n    这为Contribution 4（toolkit）增加了新维度：practitioner需要不同的reproducibility budget 取决于他们是在evaluating还是training。\n    Caveats: (a) 仅RoBERTa（encoder-only），decoder fine-tuning可能完全不同； (b) 仅1 GPU，GPU\n    × seed交互未测试；(c) 2/4 tasks不够做task gradient analysis。 论文中应作为Discussion section的\"complementary\n    evidence\"呈现，不作为独立claim。'\n- name: LayerCast Precision Mitigation\n  plan_id: exp-007\n  description: 未完成——P2优先级，依赖exp-001。compute budget优先分配给P0/P1实验。\n  expected_results:\n    projected_if_completed:\n      layercast_precision_x_item_reduction: estimated 40-60% reduction vs pure fp16\n      layercast_G_improvement: estimated +0.02-0.05 over fp16 baseline\n      layercast_latency_overhead: ~15-25% slower than pure fp16\n      note: projections based on LayerCast design (fp16 storage + fp32 compute)\n  result_rationale: LayerCast通过在存储层使用fp16但计算层使用fp32来减少precision artifacts。 预计能减少precision×item交互40-60%，因为most\n    numerical errors发生在compute layer （矩阵乘法的cumulative rounding），而LayerCast在此处使用fp32。\n    但不能完全消除precision效应因为fp16 storage仍有representation precision loss。 作为mitigation\n    strategy的价值在于提供\"actionable recommendation\"—— 但缺失实验意味着这个recommendation只能作为speculation出现在Discussion中。\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: exp-007缺失对论文影响小——LayerCast是P2优先级的mitigation validation， 不影响核心claims。可在Future\n    Work中提到：\"LayerCast and mixed-precision strategies may reduce precision×item interaction;\n    validation is ongoing.\"\n- name: MATH Benchmark Extension\n  plan_id: exp-008\n  description: 未完成——P2优先级，依赖exp-002。compute budget不足。\n  expected_results:\n    projected_if_completed:\n      item_id_pct:\n      - 35\n      - 42\n      prompt_x_item_pct:\n      - 10\n      - 15\n      temp_x_item_pct:\n      - 8\n      - 14\n      residual_pct:\n      - 22\n      - 30\n      single_model_G:\n      - 0.35\n      - 0.42\n      reasoning_variance_note: MATH items involve multi-step proofs where chain-of-thought\n        introduces substantially more stochastic variance than GSM8K. Expected lowest\n        item_id of all benchmarks and highest temperature sensitivity.\n  result_rationale: MATH是最强的reasoning benchmark——problems需要multi-step proof而非single-step\n    arithmetic。 Chain-of-thought在每步引入branching possibilities，使得同一item在不同temperature/prompt下\n    走完全不同的reasoning path。这将temperature×item和prompt×item推到最高水平， 同时压低item_id。如果完成，MATH将是gradient的第5个点：\n    MMLU(60%) > HellaSwag(54%) > GSM8K(44%) > ARC(42%) > MATH(~38%)， 可能修复或加剧ARC anomaly。\n    缺失意味着gradient仅有4个benchmark，statistical power有限。\n  tables: []\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: exp-008缺失使gradient分析限于4个benchmarks。如果MATH的item_id低于ARC（如projected）， ARC\n    anomaly会更明显（ARC不在expected位置上），gradient叙事更难成立。 反之，如果MATH的item_id高于ARC，可能重新排列gradient使其更接近monotonic。\n    无论如何，4个benchmarks已足够支撑\"benchmark-conditional\"的结论—— 不一定需要monotonic gradient，只需要证明variance\n    structure因benchmark而异。\n","numLines":1126,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1126}}}
